# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is gitignored —
# never commit it. Reference: scripts/jules.sh reads JULES_API_KEY from here.
#
# Jules API key (https://developers.google.com/jules/api):
#   Create/rotate at https://jules.google.com/settings#api (max 3 keys).
#   Sent as the `X-Goog-Api-Key` header by scripts/jules.sh.
#   The key is NEVER printed by scripts/jules.sh (status output is masked).
#   If a key leaks publicly, Google auto-disables it — rotate immediately.
#JULES_API_KEY=
